2026-07-27T11:04:04.6982818Z i /tmp/RtmpfrWGu9/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:04:04.6983187Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:04:04.6983624Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:04:04.6983999Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:04:04.6984579Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:04:04.6985460Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:04:04.6986463Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
